Yep. I’d turn it into a small **CampusNav color system** so you guys can use the same colors consistently across the React app, Mapbox UI, buttons, cards, admin dashboard, etc.

### 🎨 CampusNav Color Palette

| Color             | Hex       | Use                                                                                                                     |
| ----------------- | --------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| **Deep Navy**     | `#0B1F33` | Primary brand color. Headers, primary navigation elements, important text, dark UI surfaces, logo.                      |
| **Navy Blue**     | `#163A5C` | Secondary brand color. Hover states, secondary buttons, selected navigation elements, map controls.                     |
| **Emerald Green** | `#18A673` | **Main action/accent color.** Route lines, primary CTA buttons, selected buildings, active states, confirmation states. |
| **Mint**          | `#DDF7ED` | Light emerald background. Accessibility indicators, selected/active cards, success backgrounds, subtle highlights.      |
| **Warm White**    | `#F7F8F6` | Main application background. Keeps the interface softer than pure white.                                                |
| **White**         | `#FFFFFF` | Cards, bottom sheets, search bars, modals, floating controls and other elevated surfaces.                               |
| **Almost Black**  | `#10202F` | Primary text. Headings, building names, important information.                                                          |
| **Slate**         | `#64748B` | Secondary/muted text. Descriptions, metadata, distances, timestamps, hints.                                             |
| **Blue**          | `#3B82F6` | **User location/GPS.** Current-location dot, location accuracy indicator and GPS-related actions.                       |
| **Amber**         | `#F59E0B` | Warnings and attention states. GPS unavailable, incomplete information, route warnings, etc.                            |
| **Red**           | `#E5484D` | Errors, destructive actions, rejected community pins, failed requests and validation errors.                            |
| **Purple**        | `#7C3AED` | Accessibility-related features and indicators. Could also be used for special map layers.                               |
| **Orange**        | `#F97316` | Community/crowdsourced pins. This makes user-submitted locations visually distinct from official campus data.           |

